# ==========================================================================
#  .gitignore
#  Goal: track the lightweight project (code, docs, CSV) on GitHub.
#  NEVER upload the point-cloud data — it is large and irreplaceable (RULE 0).
#  Raw + processed clouds stay LOCAL ONLY.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Point-cloud data: never upload, any location ---------------------------
# Matches by extension so a stray cloud saved anywhere is still excluded.
*.ply
*.las
*.laz
*.e57
*.pcd
*.pts
*.xyz
*.bin

# --- Data working folders: keep the folder, ignore its contents -------------
# (The clouds live here; the trailing '!.gitkeep' keeps the empty dir in git
#  so the project structure is preserved online.)
raw_ply/*
!raw_ply/.gitkeep
cleaned/*
!cleaned/.gitkeep
stitched/*
!stitched/.gitkeep
slices/*
!slices/.gitkeep

# results/ : keep plots + result CSVs tracked (they are small and worth
# versioning), but never a point cloud (already excluded by extension above).

# Private spreadsheet: keep the working .xlsx out of GitHub.
field_measurements_working.xlsx

# Private mapping workbook: keep it local and out of GitHub.
TreeTag_to_CodeTreeTag.xlsx

# Local handoff / private instructions file.
CLAUDE.md

# --- Office / OneDrive temp + lock files ------------------------------------
~$*
.~lock.*
*.tmp
# Note: the stray random-name Office temp (e.g. field_data/sedkMyy4t) is best
# just deleted once Excel is closed rather than pattern-matched here.

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/
# Virtual environment: large + machine-specific. Recreate from requirements.txt;
# never commit it.
TreeDiameter_Environment/

# --- OS junk ----------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Editor / IDE -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
